# node-linker=hoisted
#
# This repo is routinely checked out on network/SMB filesystems (e.g. the
# Z:\ NAS share on Windows), where pnpm's default isolated layout cannot
# create junctions/symlinks in node_modules (SMB/NAS rejects them:
# "requires NTFS" / "UNKNOWN: unknown error, symlink ..."). That makes
# `pnpm install` fail with ERR_PNPM_UNKNOWN.
#
# node-linker=hoisted uses a flat (hoisted) node_modules with no links,
# which works on any filesystem including SMB/NAS and Linux containers.
# It is a fully supported pnpm mode; the Docker build remains unaffected
# (hoisted is valid inside containers too).
node-linker=hoisted
